@startuml
title Sequence Diagram - Mengubah Alamat Pengiriman

actor "Pelanggan" as Pelanggan
participant "Keranjang / Checkout\nView" as CheckoutView
participant "App (state)" as AppState

Pelanggan -> CheckoutView : Klik "Ubah" pada Profil & alamat
CheckoutView -> AppState : onStartEditAddress()
AppState --> CheckoutView : setAddressDraft(alamat); setIsEditingAddress(true)
CheckoutView --> Pelanggan : Tampilkan dialog "Ubah Alamat Pengiriman"

Pelanggan -> CheckoutView : Isi nama penerima, telepon, alamat, catatan

alt klik "Simpan" & kolom wajib terisi
    CheckoutView -> AppState : setAddress(draft)
    CheckoutView --> AppState : setIsEditingAddress(false)
    CheckoutView --> Pelanggan : Toast: "Alamat pengiriman diperbarui"
else klik X / Esc
    CheckoutView --> AppState : setIsEditingAddress(false)
end

@enduml